  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: "33 · Butterflies & fish (vertex animation)"
  description: "Cheap vertex animation. Butterflies: a horizontal subdivided quad whose vertices move up and down by a sine masked with 1 - sin(PI * u), so the body stays still and the wings flap. Fish: a subdivided vertical quad whose vertices move along their normal with a travelling sine wave, masked so the tail moves more. (The quads are subdivided by DemoProceduralMesh - a 4-vertex quad cannot bend.)"
  controls: "Right mouse drag: orbit · Wheel: zoom · Middle mouse drag: pan\nN / B: next / previous demo · M: menu · H: hide this panel"
  showPanel: 1
